# ==============================================================================
# Civic Air Quality Briefing Studio — Environment Configuration Template
# ==============================================================================
# For Vercel Deployment:
#   Set GEMINI_API_KEY in your Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
#
# For Local Development:
#   Windows PowerShell: Copy-Item .env.example .env.local
#   macOS / Linux:      cp .env.example .env.local
#
# SECURITY NOTICE:
# - Gemini API keys are server-side secrets used by /api/generate-briefing.
# - Never prefix server-side secret keys with 'VITE_'.
# - Never commit '.env.local' or live API keys to version control.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Google Gemini AI Configuration (Server-Side Secret)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Obtain an API key from Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/
# Add this to Vercel Environment Variables as GEMINI_API_KEY:
GEMINI_API_KEY="your_google_ai_studio_gemini_api_key_here"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Firebase Services Configuration (OPTIONAL - Enables Cloud Storage & Auth)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If left blank, the application operates in offline-first mode using LocalStorage.
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY="your_firebase_web_api_key"
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN="your-project-id.firebaseapp.com"
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID="your-project-id"
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET="your-project-id.appspot.com"
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID="your_messaging_sender_id"
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID="your_firebase_web_app_id"
